'''Sprite Spring''' is a [[Locations|location]] that becomes accessible after finishing the [[Stardew:Quests#Goblin_Problem|Magic Ink Quest]]. 

It is a healing spring with many foragables including seasonal flowers, and later rare forage items such as Sweet Gem Berries. More forage is found hidden behind the central waterfall in Sprite Spring Cave. 

Access to this location is first only possible through a secret passage through the trees in the southeast of [[Forest West]]. Later on, a warp can be created after having access to the [[Enchanted Grove]].
{{TOC}}
==The Spring==
The waters of the Spring function in the same manner as the [[Stardew:Spa|Spa]]. Additionally, remaining in the water for a short period of time will provide a buff with a duration of 11:59. The Spring only provides one kind of buff, per day, but it can be reobtained at will by re-entering the water. 

The possibilities of buffs are:
*{{NameSDV|Attack|+3}}
*{{NameSDV|Farming|+3|alt=Farming#Farming Skill}}
*{{NameSDV|Fishing|+3|alt=Fishing#Fishing Skill}}
*{{NameSDV|Mining|+3|alt=Mining#Mining Skill}}
*{{NameSDV|Foraging|+3|alt=Foraging#Foraging Skill}}

==Cave==
[[File:Sprite Spring Cave.png|right|250px]]
The Cave is located behind larger waterfall to the right and has it's own unique and rare foragables. 
